Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaboo! Yaboo! Yaboo! Yaboo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.87,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to pay up, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.37,0:01:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It only needs one of us, so I'm\Nletting the seal take me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:01:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.48,0:02:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it all a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing I remember, we were...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Skye, get back here! Skye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no way to treat our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry if she woke you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already met Skye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.37,0:02:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the one who found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She was sniffing around for food and\Nended up sniffing out you guys instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Skye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.61,0:03:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I see your strength is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleased to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You two had me worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, the name is Ironheart,\Nand I believe this belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for being intrusive,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.31,0:03:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't help noticing you\Npossess the legendary Eye of Tomaeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one of its kind. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not deserving of its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold it until you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find another kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He had glasses and a bad haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was on the train\Nwith us when it crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid you were\Nthe only ones we found.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps your friend was able to escape\Nbefore the train fell off that cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you there wasn't\Nanother soul on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt Weevil was able to\Nescape, not in the condition he was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's a\Ngreater power at work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you seem to possess a wisdom that\Nreaches far beyond your years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I've encountered\Nmany people in my travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's something about\Nyou I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Something in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also sensing that you hold a great\Ndeal of loneliness in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because I recently lost a\Nvery close friend of mine, and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey to find his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do if you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll apologize for betraying\Nhis trust and abandoning him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I might just be able to help
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mr. Ironheart, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.05,0:04:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I mention to watch your step?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and it's probably better if\Nyou don't look down. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Our destination's not\Nvery far from here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens when we arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have crossed over to the other side,\Nto the place where the spirits dwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, my people believe that\Nhuman souls exist all around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And just beyond this\Nmountain is a sacred valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,where drifting souls are said\Nto gather as they wander along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And you think my friend may be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but there are\Nevil spirits there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding the soul you seek is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving with your own is another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.89,0:05:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe it to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pharaoh, you in there or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.99,0:05:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find you, Pharaoh, wherever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is. So what do\Nwe do when we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not we You must enter the Sacred\NCircle on your own After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.55,0:06:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,this is your journey Very\Nwell, I accept the challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Téa, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one soul seeker is\Npermitted to enter at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you proceed, the evil spirits\Nwill sense you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.51,0:06:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I know you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends attracting lost\Nsouls that seek revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.09,0:07:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother's kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your spirit will join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm letting the shield go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.05,0:08:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that, Teya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It means the spirit's crossing\Nover into our world. Keep watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all this way\Njust to see me? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say how sorry I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish this whole thing never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I surrendered to my inner darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I allowed my anger to take\Nover and you paid the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,the darkness is starting to grow\Nwithout your light to keep me pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm becoming evil, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:09:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to believe that what\NRaphael said about me is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I was a wicked pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How you ruled as an evil king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You used the power of the\NShadow Realm to destroy Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I am the one responsible\Nfor the destruction of Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm capable of such horrific behavior
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,that it's my soul that\Nshould be locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what good is that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's been\Nlocked away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Well, the last thing I need is\Nyour pity Pharaoh if you're really evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing to\Ndo What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself didn't you\Nyour spirit should be locked
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,away with mine and I'm gonna do\Nit Wait you misunderstood me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so now you're taking back\Nwhat you said make up your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't deserve to be\Na part of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:10:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time you started taking some\Nresponsibility for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing\Nleft to do and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be a man for once\Nand face me in a duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.01,0:10:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.53,0:10:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're really sorry,\Nthen you'll do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.61,0:10:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so he's gonna duel himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we took you guys here, so\Nthe pharaoh can face his other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to deal with what he did so he can\Nput it all behind him and finally move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.61,0:10:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've always known this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We were taught that a warrior\Nwould come to save our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as we found you guys,\Nwe knew that he was the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's he supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,His first step is to\Nface his inner fears and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,conquer the darkness that\Nlurks within his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:11:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he loses this battle, the\NPharaoh's spirit will remain here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll start things off by\Nsummoning one monster face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what you've got,\Nunless you're too scared. Very
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,well if i must i summon gazelle\Nthe king of mythical beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,now gazelle attack his face down card
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,mine's a gazelle too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,they played the same card\Ntheir hands are identical
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're holding the same cards, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon another card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do these look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Polymerization and Burf-O-Met.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:12:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can fuse my two monsters together to\Nform Chimera, the flying mythical beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.15,0:12:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll play Alpha, the Magnet Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, attack his face down, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your defense is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Chimera, attack his life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do have the same hand, then\Nwhy didn't Yugi play Monster Reborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He could have used it to bring back\Nhis gazelle and block my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, he's holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Yugi be trying to\Nlose the duel on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is he trying to throw me off with\Na strategy he's never used before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When you destroyed my Sandkin,\Nyou activated its special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.47,0:12:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,letting me move a monster\Nfrom my deck to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, good move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I place this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.21,0:13:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Card Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can start over and our\Nhands will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can't cheat anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you acting like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a reflection of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.27,0:13:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So the darkness that's in your\Nheart is also inside my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I wish I could\Ntake it back. Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.23,0:13:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already shown\Nme who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,An evil pharaoh who\Ncares only about himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Face the facts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't care what happened\Nto me so long as you had power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn! Yugi, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you holding the card I think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're starting to\Ncatch on, aren't you, your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is a chance for you to\Nlook at yourself from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's only one card\Nthat can make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.19,0:14:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seal of Orikalkos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's payback time for taking my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.81,0:14:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just replace your hand already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.53,0:14:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I played Car Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Or don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for my next move,\NI activate Monster Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and i'll use it to bring\Nback my dark magician girl
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,then i'll summon my\Nobnoxious chelchic guardian
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh you know what happens next stop
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.57,0:14:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,this now now the orichalco\Nserves my monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my Celtic Guardian,\Ndestroy his Magnet Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Incinerate his mythical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use Chimera's special ability\Nto summon Burplenet in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What else have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The mighty Big Shield\NGardener in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This should protect my life points\Nfrom Dark Magician Girl's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Queen's Knight in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And to boost my firepower,\NI'll activate Magic Formula!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:16:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It raises Dark Magician\NGirl's attack points by 500!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,3,000 attack points?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen's Knight, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.15,0:16:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for my Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take out his Big Shield Gardener!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, there's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.65,0:16:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Kilted Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.19,0:16:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And it only gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.07,0:16:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll be locked away\Nforever, where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down and summon\NGiant Soldier of Stone in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I activate my Swords\Nof the Feeling Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:17:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This gives me three turns to\Ntalk some sense into Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your swords mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a card that can\Nblast right through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have known that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a card you've played before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.31,0:17:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice my guardian\Nto summon Catapult Turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I did last time. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's time for you to experience\Nthe consequences of your own evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll never duel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Queen's\NKnight, I sacrifice you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.71,0:17:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.63,0:17:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl, your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch, Catapult Turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.31,0:17:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch, Catapult Turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.13,0:18:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack and you'll become a\Nprisoner of the Orichalcos just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do, then I can't set you free\Nand two worlds will crumble. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're evil, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time, you didn't care who suffered!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't go through\Nwith this! Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.17,0:18:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the trap card, Divine Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.99,0:18:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was able to reverse my attack and\Ndouble its strength to win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done? Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.73,0:19:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak to me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You passed the test, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you plan this all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By defeating me, you were able to defeat\Nthe darkness that was inside your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy, but you did what\Nwas best for me and for mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You acted like a true hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I'm always with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes.
